 seed of life granting the right to grow the next scale of the universe\u2019s fractal plane molded in the image of its champion. In this contest of deities & fiends, an ancient fallen foe, the shapeshifter of endless names, set aim on claiming & destroying the seed, to reset time & space for without a new scale all existence will collapse into a big bang. But Optimist have faith! As you have uploaded into this future body & mind, so too our last champion has into your own, the one who reigned by his word without ever lifting a blade, but now robes must stain red, less to the abyss we all slip. Godspeed to victory may you lead in the Optimum Championship!", "short_description": "Are you ready to take on deities & fiends in the ultimate fight for survival? Are you ready to be OPTIMUM?   "}]}, "developer_name": "Optimum Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.optimum.college/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Optimum College", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.optimum.college/championship", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8684149351710872"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/468731145_808391144761649_796137040071478195_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&cc